WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.014 --> 00:00:05.085
Meet the living banner. It follows your park's own clock, so the sun really rises.

2
00:00:05.446 --> 00:00:09.003
By day, a little plane tows your park's name across the sky.

3
00:00:09.366 --> 00:00:14.032
It shows your park's real weather too, like rain, snow, fog or a storm.

4
00:00:14.396 --> 00:00:18.955
At dusk the sky glows, headlights come on, and searchlights spell your words.

5
00:00:19.325 --> 00:00:23.074
At night, tonight's real moon crosses the sky in its true phase.

6
00:00:23.447 --> 00:00:27.238
Every season has its own touch, like falling leaves in the fall.

7
00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:31.622
All October, mummies roam the road, and some chase the headlights.

8
00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:36.126
In December, Santa's sleigh flies by, with Rudolph leading the way.

9
00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:40.137
And at midnight on New Year's Eve, a big fireworks finale.

10
00:00:41.492 --> 00:00:45.646
Turn each part on or off in Settings, under Website hero banner.
